## 2. System Architecture & End-to-End Flow

### High-Level Workflow Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Referrer as Referrer User
    actor Referee as Referee (Friend)
    participant Worker as Remindly Cloudflare Worker
    participant PlayStore as Google Play Store
    participant Firestore as Google Cloud Firestore
    participant RTDN as Google Play Pub/Sub RTDN

    %% Step 1: Code Generation
    Referrer->>Worker: GET /v1/referral/code (Bearer Token)
    Worker->>Firestore: getOrCreateUserReferralCode(referrerUid)
    Firestore-->>Worker: ReferralDoc (e.g. REMINDLY-JOHN12AB)
    Worker-->>Referrer: { referralCode, inviteUrl }

    %% Step 2: Share and Click
    Referrer->>Referee: Shares inviteUrl (https://remindly.app/invite?ref=REMINDLY-JOHN12AB)
    Referee->>Worker: GET /invite?ref=REMINDLY-JOHN12AB
    Worker-->>Referee: HTTP 302 Redirect to Play Store with &referrer=utm_source%3Dreferral...
    Referee->>PlayStore: Installs Remindly App (Play Store retains install referrer)

    %% Step 3: Install & Claim
    Referee->>Worker: POST /v1/referral/claim { referralCode: "REMINDLY-JOHN12AB" } (Bearer Token)
    Worker->>Firestore: Validate code, check self-referral, save users/{uid}/referral/current
    Worker-->>Referee: { success: true, message: "Referral claimed successfully" }

    %% Step 4: Promo Code Reward
    Referee->>Worker: GET /v1/referral/reward (Bearer Token)
    Worker->>Firestore: Atomic claim from promoCodes pool (status: available -> assigned)
    Worker-->>Referee: { success: true, promoCode: "PROMO123", redemptionUrl: "https://play.google.com/redeem?code=..." }

    %% Step 5: Redemption & Sync
    Referee->>PlayStore: Redeems promo code in Google Play
    PlayStore->>RTDN: Subscription Purchase Event
    RTDN->>Worker: POST /v1/billing/rtdn
    Worker->>Firestore: markUserReferralRedeemed(refereeUid) -> status: "redeemed"
```

